  {
   "user": "Tim",
   "message": "- [1 — thumb](https://discord.com/channels/1510645022645555321/1532914061128368249/1534878445383843930)\n    - The “opposing digit” that allows *holding* (of a tool, of meaning, of food)\n    - In piano playing, the thumb (1, historically marked X) is a major axis around which different fingers can turn.",
   "timestamp": "2026-08-06T11:14:18.598000+00:00",
   "channel": "general",
