   "message": "- [2 — pointer / index](https://discord.com/channels/1510645022645555321/1532914087518797965/1534878466606895114)\n    - socially legible indication mechanisms (words, references)\n    - In piano playing, the index finger (2, historically 1) is the closest to the “center” of the weight of the hand, and so is used in most gestural patterns.",
