   "user": "Tim",
   "message": "- [3 — middle](https://discord.com/channels/1510645022645555321/1532914098763862127/1534878510274052297)\n    - profanity, obscenity [“the bird”](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_finger), criticism, phallic imagery, low-brow and crude\n    - In piano playing, the middle finger (3, historically 2) is the first of the “weak fingers” and is said to have the strongest individual personality for each pianist.",
