  },
  {
   "user": "Tim",
   "message": "The order of the fingers from left to right is reversed between the two hands. The left hand’s pinky plays the low extremes, and the right hand’s pinky plays the high extremes. This naturally, in gestural playing, results in a different “voice” or “instrumentation” for each hand.",
   "timestamp": "2026-08-06T11:16:21.417000+00:00",
   "channel": "general",
   "channel_id": "discord:1532905838883242114",
   "thread": "five chats, five fingers",
   "thread_id": "discord:1534879057693507654",
