   "server_id": "discord:1510645022645555321"
  },
  {
   "user": "Tim",
   "message": "I am writing this out and sending it here to inspire others to consider what the desks could “mean”, even though they just have numbers. What they mean to me may or may not influence what they mean to you.",
   "timestamp": "2026-08-06T11:17:36.296000+00:00",
   "channel": "general",
   "channel_id": "discord:1532905838883242114",
   "thread": "five chats, five fingers",
