   "server_id": "discord:1510645022645555321"
  },
  {
   "user": "Tim",
   "message": "A summary of the headings that *I* would assign to each of these desks, in my own head canon:\n- `#desk-one` Meta / Functional\n- `#desk-two` Exoterica / Legible\n- `#desk-three` Esoterica / Illegible\n- `#desk-four` Community / Balance\n- `#desk-five` Scope / Boundary",
   "timestamp": "2026-08-06T11:22:45.373000+00:00",
   "channel": "general",
   "channel_id": "discord:1532905838883242114",
   "thread": "five chats, five fingers",
   "thread_id": "discord:1534879057693507654",
   "reply_to": null,
   "id": "discord:1534884432043835492",
   "user_id": "discord:177129656611373056",
   "is_bot": false,
   "url": "https://discord.com/channels/1510645022645555321/1534879057693507654/1534884432043835492",
   "attachments": [],
   "platform": "discord",
   "server": "ORI 2.0",
   "server_id": "discord:1510645022645555321"
  },
  {
   "user": "Tim",
   "message": "There are also various mnemonics related to praying; the rosary is a famous one for Catholics that *uses* the hands but is framed with beads. I myself use my hands for counting on the joints, and I once heard a preacher at our church use the five fingers to represent five classes of people who need our prayers. Online, I found [a different example of a prayer hand](https://www.navigators.org/resource/the-prayer-hand/) that maps confession, petition, intercession, thanksgiving, and praise to the five fingers, starting from the pinky.",
   "timestamp": "2026-08-06T11:26:00.931000+00:00",
   "channel": "general",
   "channel_id": "discord:1532905838883242114",
   "thread": "five chats, five fingers",
   "thread_id": "discord:1534879057693507654",
   "reply_to": null,
   "id": "discord:1534885252273541236",
   "user_id": "discord:177129656611373056",
   "is_bot": false,
   "url": "https://discord.com/channels/1510645022645555321/1534879057693507654/1534885252273541236",
   "attachments": [],
   "platform": "discord",
   "server": "ORI 2.0",
   "server_id": "discord:1510645022645555321"
  },
  {
   "user": "Tim",
   "message": "The [Guidonian hand](https://x.com/sunriseoath/status/1929379691451896197?s=20) is a different musical mnemonic that maps hexachord solfege syllables (a precursor to our modern solfege systems, having mixed functions of both “fixed” and “movable” systems) to locations on one’s hand.",
   "timestamp": "2026-08-06T11:28:42.121000+00:00",
